      "trackName": "Coin Flip CT",
      "description": "Need to make a difficult decision? Try your luck with this app.\n\nCoinTosser is a simple coin tossing/flipping app. You can use it to simulate tossing a real coin when you don't have one.\n\nSome of the main features of CoinTosser include:\n\n1. A simple and easy to use interface.\n2. The ability to change chance/percentage outcomes from the settings screen.\n3. The ability to flip the coin by tapping or shaking your device.\n4. 3 different styles of coin to use.\n5. Optional sound.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/cointoss-app",
